# ACL Mosquitto cible pour la borne.
#
# Le backend lit toute la télémétrie et peut publier des commandes.
# Le Raspberry publie les commandes vers les ESP32.
# Chaque ESP32 publie sa télémétrie et ses ACK, et écoute sa commande.

user station_backend
topic readwrite station/health
topic read station/+/telemetry
topic read station/+/status
topic read station/+/alert
topic read station/+/ack
topic write station/+/cmd
# Autorisé pour le simulateur local lancé côté backend.
topic write station/+/telemetry

user raspberry_kiosk
topic read station/+/ack
topic write station/+/cmd

user esp32_slot1
topic read station/slot1/cmd
topic write station/slot1/telemetry
topic write station/slot1/status
topic write station/slot1/alert
topic write station/slot1/ack

user esp32_slot2
topic read station/slot2/cmd
topic write station/slot2/telemetry
topic write station/slot2/status
topic write station/slot2/alert
topic write station/slot2/ack

user esp32_slot3
topic read station/slot3/cmd
topic write station/slot3/telemetry
topic write station/slot3/status
topic write station/slot3/alert
topic write station/slot3/ack
